# Privacy policy URL stability. The App Store listing points at
# /privacy/animal-restaurant-tracker/ forever; these 301s catch the plausible
# near-misses so a mistyped or legacy link never 404s on a live listing.
# Targets keep the trailing slash: that form serves 200 directly, so an alias
# resolves in a single hop instead of chaining through a second redirect.
/animal-restaurant-tracker/privacy   /privacy/animal-restaurant-tracker/   301
/privacy/animal-restaurant-tracker-app   /privacy/animal-restaurant-tracker/   301
/privacy/animalrestauranttracker   /privacy/animal-restaurant-tracker/   301
/privacy/attendize   /attendize/privacy/   301
/privacy/shut   /privacy/#shut   301
/shut/privacy   /privacy/#shut   301
/shut/support   /shut/#support   301
